# LinnexAgent и Platform MCP (LaraOnly)

LinnexAgent — desktop-клиент (Goose fork). **Канон продукта: LaraOnly** — единственное platform-окно = flow `lara` на branch `linnex_agent`; локальный ПК — через tunnel device tools внутри Lara. На legacy brand `humanitec.ru` продукт называется **HumanitecAgent**. **Код домена** — `apps/agent/`.

## Два HTTP-surface

| Surface | Сервис | Базовый path | Назначение |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Control plane** | `frontend` (:8002) | `/frontend/api/agent/*` | pairing, register, devices, policy, audit, download, releases |
| **Tunnel WS** | `frontend` | `WS /frontend/api/agent/tunnel?token=` | desktop → platform; ping/pong, policy, `mcp_request`/`mcp_response` |
| **Platform MCP** | `flows` (:8001) | `/flows/api/v1/agent/platform-mcp` | Streamable HTTP MCP (union + `device/mcp`) |
| **Platform MCP (toolkit)** | `flows` | `/flows/api/v1/agent/platform-mcp/{toolkit_id}` | scoped MCP; desktop использует **`/platform-mcp/lara`** |
| **Toolkits catalog** | `flows` | `GET /flows/api/v1/agent/toolkits` | для **device JWT** — только toolkit `lara` |
| **Toolkits manage** | `flows` | `/flows/api/v1/agent/toolkits/manage` | CRUD групп (session JWT; admin) |
| **A2A** | `flows` | `/flows/api/v1/a2a/*` | исполнение flow |

**Platform MCP не в frontend.** Router `apps/agent/platform_mcp.py` → `apps/flows/main.py`.

## LaraOnly

| Инвариант | Деталь |
|---|---|
| Desktop catalog | Device JWT → только `lara` (`default_enabled: true`) |
| MCP tool | `flow_lara` → A2A `metadata.branch = linnex_agent` |
| Sticky session | Redis: `Mcp-Session-Id` **или** `device:{device_id}` → A2A `context_id`; result text содержит `context_id: …` |
| Local PC | Builtin `device_tools_list` / `device_tools_call` на branch; `device_id` из variables (device JWT), не из LLM args |
| Tunnel local MCP | Built-in desktop surface (`humanitecLocalDeviceMcp.ts`) под `DevicePolicy`; optional `HUMANITEC_LOCAL_MCP_URL` override |
| Updates | Skills/tools/prompts Lara — DB/seed; desktop binary не пересобирать ради platform |

Не делать: Goose skills mirror platform Agent Skills; multi-toolkit flat MCP как primary desktop surface.

## AgentToolkit

Database-first (`apps/flows/src/models/agent_toolkit.py`). Bootstrap: `registry.yaml` → `agent_toolkits`. Системные: `lara` (desktop default on), `humanitec_core` (legacy, default off), `networkle`, `docs`, `files`, `browser`.

## Pairing и device JWT

1. `POST /frontend/api/agent/pairing` → Redis code  
2. `POST /frontend/api/agent/register` → device JWT + URLs  
3. Revoke → denylist + tunnel disconnect  

## Platform MCP — контракт

| Method | Поведение |
|---|---|
| `tools/list` | membership toolkit (desktop: `flow_lara`) |
| `tools/call` `flow_*` | A2A; для `lara` — branch `linnex_agent` + variables `device_id` / `linnex_agent_client` |
| `tools/call` `tool_*` | `tool_registry.materialize` |
| `device/mcp` | proxy → tunnel → local MCP (timeout 120s) |

Sticky keys: `agent_mcp_session:{mcp_session}:flow:{flow_id}` и `agent_mcp_session:device:{device_id}:flow:{flow_id}`.

## Tunnel WS

- `policy` → DevicePolicy (gates local MCP)
- `mcp_request` / `mcp_response` → `device_*` tools и Platform MCP `device/mcp`
- `toolkits_updated` → desktop resync (LaraOnly: обычно один extension `platform_lara`)

## Desktop (Goose)

- Distro `default_extensions`: `developer`, `computercontroller` (локальный fallback UI; канон local — Lara device tools)
- Branding: `humanitecToolkitsSync.ts`, `humanitecTunnelClient.ts`, `humanitecLocalDeviceMcp.ts`, `humanitecAgentRuntime.ts`
- Releases: `linnex-agent-{sha}` / `LinnexAgent-{platform}-{sha}.{ext}`

